# "sync lead" on the lead track: a short phrase with velocities 40 .. 127 (velocity also moves the ratio), then one
# held note with the classic sync sweep, P1 0 -> 255 -> 0, and a bend on top.
tempo 110
steps 32
tail 1.5
track lead
preset 110 40 0 90 210 50 0 0 128 0 128 195 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 A4 2 127
note 2 C5 1 80
note 3 D5 1 40
note 4 E5 2 127
note 6 G5 2 100
note 8 E5 4 127
bend 10 -200
bend 12 0
param p1 0 16
sweep p1 0 255 16 26
sweep p1 255 0 26 32
note 16 A4 16 127
bend 28 200
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 60
expect peak_below -6
